# Binding Negotiation: "Target opponent reveals their hand. You may choose a nonland card from it. If you do, they discard
# it. Otherwise, you may put a face-up exiled card they own into their graveyard." Bot1 exiled its Simian Spirit Guide for
# mana on turn 1. On turn 2 Bot2 chooses Bot1's Duress from the revealed hand (an Island is not offered: nonland only), and
# Bot1 discards it. A card was chosen, so the exile part is never offered: Bot2 is asked nothing more and the Spirit Guide
# stays in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Simian Spirit Guide
Duress
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Binding Negotiation
Swamp x12

