Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Binding Negotiation.Cast(Bot1)
! Bot2.Choose(Island)
Bot2.Choose(Duress)
! Bot2.Choose

